<title>USA: Disney Interactive cuts 90 staff - paper.</title>
<headline>Disney Interactive cuts 90 staff - paper.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Walt Disney's Disney Interactive unit confirmed the company has laid off 90 of its 425 staffers, Daily Variety said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The company was the latest to suffer casualties in a weakening entertainment CD-ROM business, the report said.</p>
<p>A number of freelancers and independent contractors were also released, Daily Variety said.</p>
<p>Disney was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>--New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
